<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Best Buy off recommend list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Best Buy off recommend list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it cut Best Buy Co Inc from its small cap recommended list on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Salomon said &quot;comps are not near where we thought they would be at this time in the fall shopping season,&quot; in a research report.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 5/8 to 17-3/8.</p>
</text>
